WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.913
First: yesterday VK-NPI-03 had a finding.

3
00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:09.337
Today its read failed
with a four-oh-three.

4
00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:11.126
What does the comparison report?

5
00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:14.612
The answer is b: unverified, not resolved.

6
00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:19.038
A failed read is never a fix, and
you saw it in step five of the lab.

7
00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:23.763
Second: how does the ISSO check a
package without the program's code?

8
00:00:23.763 --> 00:00:27.665
The answer is b: with
sha two fifty-six sum,

9
00:00:27.665 --> 00:00:31.687
dash c, SHA256SUMS, in
the package's folder.

10
00:00:31.687 --> 00:00:36.475
You did exactly that in step seven,
and it printed nothing and exited zero.

11
00:00:36.475 --> 00:00:41.012
The module page has two more questions,
on what goes into a drafted issue

12
00:00:41.012 --> 00:00:45.700
and on what shows a missing day, each
linked to the section that answers it.
